  "details": "In my world, Jetski Islet, the jetskis are synced with VRCObjectSync. \n\nIn the live build everything looks good, but in the beta the jetskis do not interpolate for non-owners.\n\nThere are no errors in the debug log and it seems like the jetskis behave the same as they do in live, other than the interpolation issue.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\nJoin the world with at least two players.\n\nThe player that does not own the jetskis will see them with no interpolation.\n\nWorld: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7ef54852-7894-46e4-9935-7dacb78f81c5",
